    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{12}{x}$ or $12x^{-1}$.\n\nUse a common denominator when adding and subtracting the fractional indices.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3x^{-\\frac54}\\times4x^{\\frac74}}{x^{\\frac32}}&=12x^{-\\frac54+\\frac74-\\frac32} \\\\ &=12x^{-1}\\end{align*}$$",
